INFO:__main__:- name: AIAH Get Action Prompt
INFO:__main__:- description: This prompt is for the AIAH to use its knowledge (memory, consience and skills) and the environment status to take an action. This action will impact with environment
INFO:__main__:- requires: AIAH_memory, AIAH_skills, AIAH_conscience, ES_enviroment_status
INFO:__main__:Prompting GPT
INFO:httpx:HTTP Request: POST https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
INFO:__main__:
{
  "action": "Considering the current environment update and my diary entries, I plan to continue my approach of mindful resource management and ecological mindfulness. The overcast weather with light drizzle suggests that staying dry and maintaining body temperature is important, so I'll check on the integrity of the existing shelter for any potential leaks or vulnerabilities due to the weather. Given the limited food availability, I'll focus on gathering berries and mushrooms cautiously, ensuring that I don't over-harvest and affect future availability. Since the deer are approachable, I may observe them from a distance to understand their behavior better, but I’ll avoid any direct interaction to minimize stress on the wildlife. The steady stream ensures that my water needs are met, so careful water management will maintain this resource. My overall health is good, but I’ll remain vigilant about my minor illness, possibly exploring local herbs to address it. The low to moderate danger level requires increased vigilance, especially with the weather-induced vulnerability, so I'll plan activities that keep me close to the shelter and avoid unnecessary exposure. By incorporating wildlife observations into my daily activities, I aim to coexist harmoniously with the ecosystem while securing my immediate needs."
}

