INFO:__main__:- description: This prompt is for the Environment Simulator (ES) to manage the environment, and on the basis of day number, its notes, a luck factor, it presents a new environment situation for the AIAH to do an action.
INFO:__main__:- requires: ES_enviroment_status_notes, day_count, luck_factor
INFO:__main__:Prompting GPT
INFO:httpx:HTTP Request: POST https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
INFO:__main__:
{
  "environment_status": {
    "terrain": "Dense forest with a mix of rolling plains",
    "temperature": 17,
    "weather": "Partly cloudy with clearing skies",
    "food_availability": "Berries and mushrooms are available, deer are more visible",
    "water_availability": "Stream is flowing steadily",
    "shelter_options": "Previous shelter is sturdy with recent reinforcements",
    "wildlife": "Deer are present and curious, rabbits are elusive, foxes are non-threatening",
    "danger_level": "Low (cautious of slippery terrain due to recent drizzle)"
  },
  "prompt": "The forest is calming as the drizzle clears, revealing patches of blue sky. Your shelter holds strong after your recent reinforcements. You notice deer grazing nearby and hear the stream flowing steadily. What would you like to do next?"
}

