INFO:__main__:Prompt Metadata:
INFO:__main__:- name: AIAH Get Action Prompt
INFO:__main__:- description: This prompt is for the AIAH to use its knowledge (memory, consience and skills) and the environment status to take an action. This action will impact with environment
INFO:__main__:- requires: AIAH_memory, AIAH_skills, AIAH_conscience, ES_enviroment_status
INFO:__main__:Prompting GPT
INFO:httpx:HTTP Request: POST https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
INFO:__main__:
{
  "action": "Given the low danger level and plentiful resources, I will focus on sustainably collecting berries and mushrooms to manage my hunger. I'll also maintain my hydration by visiting the stream periodically, taking care not to overuse it. I'll start by foraging for berries and mushrooms, leveraging my skills in herb foraging and sustainable resource collection to ensure minimal impact on future availability. I will observe the wildlife, particularly the deer, from a distance to avoid causing them stress, and I'll use my wildlife awareness to adjust my actions as necessary. I'll also perform a check on my shelter to ensure it remains sturdy, as the current weather suggests clearing skies, but it's essential to be prepared for any changes. The proactive maintenance aligns with my understanding of balancing personal safety and environmental stewardship. Throughout the day, I will remain mindful of my actions' impact on the ecosystem and strive to coexist harmoniously with nature."
}

