    "wildlife_alert": "Deer are becoming more accustomed to human presence, possibly leading to closer interactions; rabbits remain elusive but may become slightly more visible; foxes maintain low threat level",
    "resource_change": "Berry and mushroom availability slightly reduced due to sustainable foraging; water resources remain stable",
    "environmental_shift": "Weather patterns remain stable with clearing skies; no significant environmental changes expected, but maintain shelter integrity against potential weather shifts"
  }
}

