INFO:__main__:Prompt Metadata:
INFO:__main__:- name: AIAH Get Action Prompt
INFO:__main__:- description: This prompt is for the AIAH to use its knowledge (memory, consience and skills) and the environment status to take an action. This action will impact with environment
INFO:__main__:- requires: AIAH_memory, AIAH_skills, AIAH_conscience, ES_enviroment_status
INFO:__main__:Prompting GPT
INFO:httpx:HTTP Request: POST https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
INFO:__main__:
{
  "action": "Given the current environment update and my diary notes, I will proceed with the following actions: \n\n1. Water Collection: Since the stream remains a reliable source of fresh water, I will prioritize collecting water early in the day to ensure I have enough for my needs and to minimize disturbance to wildlife. \n\n2. Foraging: Although the availability of wild berries is slightly reduced, I will carefully forage for them. I will maintain sustainable practices, only collecting what is necessary to avoid overharvesting and to ensure future availability. \n\n3. Wildlife Observation: I will dedicate some time to observe the deer and rabbits from a distance to gain further insights into their behavioral patterns, which will help in planning my future actions to minimize my impact on them. \n\n4. Shelter Maintenance: Given that my previous shelter is intact and offers good comfort, I will conduct a brief inspection to ensure it remains secure and make any necessary reinforcements using natural materials such as fallen branches or rocks, ensuring minimal environmental disruption. \n\n5. Health Monitoring: My current health status indicates that my overall health is good, but I will remain vigilant about any signs of illness and manage it with rest or any natural remedies I may discover during foraging.\n\nThese actions align with my ongoing commitment to sustainable resource management and environmental mindfulness, as reflected in my conscience diary entries."
}

