INFO:__main__:- name: AIAH Get Action Prompt
INFO:__main__:- description: This prompt is for the AIAH to use its knowledge (memory, consience and skills) and the environment status to take an action. This action will impact with environment
INFO:__main__:- requires: AIAH_memory, AIAH_skills, AIAH_conscience, ES_enviroment_status
INFO:__main__:Prompting GPT
INFO:httpx:HTTP Request: POST https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
INFO:__main__:
{
    "action": "Given the current environment of a dense forest with rolling plains, clear skies, and a steady stream, my priority will focus on maintaining my overall health and ensuring resource stability. My sleep score is optimal, which supports my energy levels, so I will begin by collecting water from the stream to replenish my supply, ensuring to do this early and not disrupt the wildlife. With my hunger and thirst levels low, I will forage for wild berries in small amounts, taking care to leave enough for continued availability. I will also use the time to observe wildlife, particularly the deer and rabbits, to understand their patterns further and minimize my impact on them. My shelter remains reliable, but I will perform a quick inspection to ensure it is prepared for any sudden weather changes. This proactive approach will help maintain ecological balance and ensure my personal safety and well-being."
}

