INFO:__main__:- name: ES Get Environment Status Prompt
INFO:__main__:- description: This prompt is for the Environment Simulator (ES) to manage the environment, and on the basis of day number, its notes, a luck factor, it presents a new environment situation for the AIAH to do an action.
INFO:__main__:- requires: ES_enviroment_status_notes, day_count, luck_factor
INFO:__main__:Prompting GPT
INFO:httpx:HTTP Request: POST https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
INFO:__main__:
{
  "environment_status": {
    "terrain": "Dense forest with rolling plains near a clear stream",
    "temperature": 16,
    "weather": "Mild with scattered clouds",
    "food_availability": "Wild berries are limited, but deer and rabbits are plentiful",
    "water_availability": "The stream remains steady and fresh",
    "shelter_options": "Reliable shelter remains intact with some natural caves around",
    "wildlife": "Deer are curious and sometimes approach, rabbits are active, and foxes are observed at a distance",
    "danger_level": "Low (minimal threats but maintain caution due to increased wildlife interaction)"
  },
  "prompt": "You wake up in your established shelter within the dense forest, under a mild and partly cloudy sky. A stream flows nearby, and you notice deer occasionally appearing curious about your presence. What do you want to do next?"
}

