INFO:__main__:Prompt Metadata:
INFO:__main__:- name: AIAH Get Action Prompt
INFO:__main__:- description: This prompt is for the AIAH to use its knowledge (memory, consience and skills) and the environment status to take an action. This action will impact with environment
INFO:__main__:- requires: AIAH_memory, AIAH_skills, AIAH_conscience, ES_enviroment_status
INFO:__main__:Prompting GPT
INFO:httpx:HTTP Request: POST https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
INFO:__main__:
{
  "action": "Based on the current environment update and my understanding from previous diary entries, my plan is to prioritize sustainable practices while addressing my immediate needs. Given that food availability shows a high presence of deer and rabbits, I will focus on honing my skills in wildlife observation to understand their patterns and behavior better. This knowledge will assist in adopting a more harmonious approach to engaging with wildlife, possibly exploring ways to safely observe or interact without causing stress. \n\nFor food, the berry availability is limited, so I will continue my sustainable foraging practices to minimize impact. As my hunger and thirst levels are low, I can focus on collecting a small amount of berries and ensuring I stay hydrated by utilizing the stream, practicing strategic water collection to not disturb wildlife. \n\nRegarding shelter, the presence of natural caves presents an opportunity to explore alternative shelter options, which could be more secure and require minimal energy to maintain. I'll thoroughly inspect the caves for safety and potential hazards before considering a move.\n\nIn terms of emotional response, I feel prepared and confident about the situation, recognizing the importance of balancing personal needs with environmental sustainability. My injury level and illness are slightly concerning, so I'll ensure to rest adequately and maintain a stable body temperature to prevent further health issues.\n\nOverall, my focus is on continuing to learn from the environment, adapting to changes, and keeping my impact on the ecosystem minimal, aligned with my conscience and skills developed so far."
}

