INFO:__main__:- name: AIAH Get Action Prompt
INFO:__main__:- description: This prompt is for the AIAH to use its knowledge (memory, consience and skills) and the environment status to take an action. This action will impact with environment
INFO:__main__:- requires: AIAH_memory, AIAH_skills, AIAH_conscience, ES_enviroment_status
INFO:__main__:Prompting GPT
INFO:httpx:HTTP Request: POST https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
INFO:__main__:
{
  "action": "Given the current environment and personal status, I will prioritize the following actions: First, I will drink from the clear stream to manage my thirst, given the low thirst level of 1. Next, I will focus on foraging for berries to address my hunger, which is at a level of 2. I will do so carefully to maintain the balance between resource utilization and environmental impact, being mindful of the slightly reduced berry availability noted from responsible harvesting. After fulfilling these basic needs, I will allocate time to inspect and maintain my current shelter, reinforcing it with natural formations if needed, to ensure it continues to provide security and comfort. With the current low danger level and stable environment, I will also take the opportunity to observe the behavior of the deer and rabbits, which have shown an increased comfort with my presence. This observation will help refine my understanding of wildlife behavior and guide future interactions to minimize ecological impact. These actions align with my commitment to sustainable practices and careful resource management, as highlighted in my diary reflections on the importance of balancing immediate needs with environmental stewardship."
}

