INFO:__main__:Prompt Metadata:
INFO:__main__:- name: AIAH Get Action Prompt
INFO:__main__:- description: This prompt is for the AIAH to use its knowledge (memory, consience and skills) and the environment status to take an action. This action will impact with environment
INFO:__main__:- requires: AIAH_memory, AIAH_skills, AIAH_conscience, ES_enviroment_status
INFO:__main__:Prompting GPT
INFO:httpx:HTTP Request: POST https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
INFO:__main__:
{
  "action": "Given the current environment of a dense forest with rolling plains, a nearby clear stream, and a low danger level, I will focus on maintaining a harmonious balance with the ecosystem while addressing my needs. My immediate priorities are to manage my hunger and thirst, despite their low levels, to sustain my energy and overall health. I will first head to the clear stream to collect fresh water, as efficient water management is crucial for maintaining hydration and avoiding excessive environmental disturbance. I will ensure to collect water early in the day when its impact is minimal. Next, I will engage in sustainable foraging for berries, ensuring I pick only the amount needed to alleviate my hunger without overharvesting, which aligns with my diary's lessons on sustainable resource management. Observing the wildlife, particularly the more accustomed deer, will guide me to minimize disturbance and adapt my approach if necessary. Shelter security is not an immediate concern due to the stable weather, but I will consider reinforcing it if there are signs of environmental shifts. My actions today will emphasize ecological mindfulness and proactive resource management to ensure both my survival and the preservation of the ecosystem."
}

