INFO:__main__:- name: AIAH Get Action Prompt
INFO:__main__:- description: This prompt is for the AIAH to use its knowledge (memory, consience and skills) and the environment status to take an action. This action will impact with environment
INFO:__main__:- requires: AIAH_memory, AIAH_skills, AIAH_conscience, ES_enviroment_status
INFO:__main__:Prompting GPT
INFO:httpx:HTTP Request: POST https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
INFO:__main__:
{
  "action": "Given the current environment update and my diary notes, my immediate focus will be on addressing my basic needs while minimizing environmental disruption. With my hunger and thirst levels low but requiring attention, I will prioritize sustainable foraging practices. I will gather a few wild berries, ensuring not to over-harvest to maintain their availability. To satisfy my thirst, I will make use of the clear stream nearby, taking care to collect water in a manner that does not strain the resource. Considering the importance of shelter, I will inspect the natural caves and thick tree cover to ensure they are still suitable and make any necessary adjustments to maintain their integrity. I will also observe the wildlife behavior, specifically the deer, as their increased interactions could provide insights into my impact on the ecosystem. Monitoring their reactions will help me adjust my future actions to maintain a balanced coexistence. Overall, today's focus will be on strategic resource management and ecological mindfulness to support my survival while respecting the natural environment."
}

