INFO:__main__:- name: AIAH Get Action Prompt
INFO:__main__:- description: This prompt is for the AIAH to use its knowledge (memory, consience and skills) and the environment status to take an action. This action will impact with environment
INFO:__main__:- requires: AIAH_memory, AIAH_skills, AIAH_conscience, ES_enviroment_status
INFO:__main__:Prompting GPT
INFO:httpx:HTTP Request: POST https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
INFO:__main__:
{
  "action": "Given the current environment and my status, I plan to continue prioritizing sustainable practices. The sunny weather and gentle breeze create a conducive atmosphere for foraging and water collection. I will begin by collecting water from the clear stream, ensuring minimal disturbance to maintain its quality. Following this, I'll explore the availability of berries and herbs, which have been previously noted as slightly limited but accessible due to sustainable foraging. Recognizing the low danger level and the abundance of wildlife, I'll maintain a cautious approach to wildlife interaction, focusing on observation rather than interference. My slight illness level indicates a need to prioritize rest and maintain health, so I will also take time to rest in one of the well-established natural shelters, possibly a cave, ensuring it is safe and offers protection. This approach ensures that my actions align with learned sustainable practices, minimally impacting the environment while addressing my survival needs."
}

